/* English strings of the watch app.

   Keys are language pack keys of the iOS app (the "ios" localization target
   on translations.telegram.org): the watch downloads their translations
   through TDLib (see LanguagePackSync.swift) and falls back to these values.

   Every key here must also exist, with the same English value, in
   Telegram/Telegram-iOS/en.lproj/Localizable.strings, which is how new keys
   reach the translation platform. Reuse an existing iOS key when its English
   text and meaning match; otherwise add a new "Watch."-prefixed key to both
   files. tools/check_watch_strings.py verifies all of this.
*/

